The assets in this repository are based on the assets prepared for ROSCon 2023 Demo located under https://github.com/RobotecAI/ROSCon2023Demo (accessed on July 24, 2024). The base assets are Robotec.ai's own work; like this gem, they are licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0.

Most of the base files, i.e., textures and models are copied without any changes. Otherwise, the changes include (but are not limited to):
- filename changes and corresponding prefabs/materials modifications
- folder structure changes and corresponding prefabs/materials modifications
- colliders removal from prefabs
- ROS 2 dependency removal from prefabs
- rotation/position modifications within prefabs

The "PlasticBarrel2" model was obtained from PolyHaven (https://polyhaven.com/a/Barrel_02, available on Sept 13, 2024) and it has CC0 license. 

The "CardboardBox" model was obtained from PolyHaven (https://polyhaven.com/a/cardboard_box_01, available on Sept 13, 2024) and it has CC0 license.

Prefab, material and assetinfo files for "PlasticBarrel2" and "CardboardBox" were created by Robotec.ai and are licensed under the CC BY-NC 4.0 license.

